Package: sir-bone-rs
Architecture: amd64
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: AI coding agent in Rust with LLM streaming, tools, REPL and TUI
 sir-bone is a from-scratch AI coding agent written in Rust: it streams
 LLM responses, runs tools (bash, file operations, web fetch) and offers
 REPL and TUI modes. It supports Anthropic and OpenAI-compatible
 providers, prompt caching, extended thinking and MCP servers.
